Adapted code: Part C camera, point-cloud, pose, sphere-calibration and IK
algorithms; Part D dynamics ensemble and CEM planner. Controller waypoints,
learning reward definitions and ACT/VLA processing are derived from A-D.

New work: common simulation core and contracts, scene/placement validation,
multi-material scenes and policies, isolated perception/privileged views,
single-owner executor, hybrid controller handovers, unified CLI, dataset and
training integration, acceptance tests, measurement and documentation.

Seven-object stage additions: parameterized seven-instance MJCF scene,
three-slot bins, visual identity/occupancy ledger, single-goal base policies,
phase-gated local-optimizer contract, sensor-only task manager, independent
truth audit, automatic multi-episode reset, manifests and acceptance gates.
Legacy M1 robot and scene assets remain unchanged.
